(153,'Sportster S joined Harley Sportster family in 2021','Harley-Davidson — Sportster history','https://www.harley-davidson.com/us/en/content/expert-advice/harley-davidson-sportster-history.html','Original 2021 introduction, not 2025 or 2026 technical figures.'),
(153,'Sportster S 2025 UK manufacturer performance','Harley-Davidson UK — 2025 Sportster S','https://www.harley-davidson.com/gb/en/motorcycles/2025/sportster-s.html','Manufacturer 2025 UK model only; not all historic Sportster models.'),
