(125,'2021 Electra Glide Revival limited Icons edition','Harley-Davidson Europe — Icons Motorcycle Collection','https://www.harley-davidson.com/eu/en/motorcycles/icons.html','2021 Electra Glide Revival specific edition, distinct from generic Electra Glide range.')
